### ==========================================
### SKENARIO PENGUJIAN TUGAS MINGGU 1 (ASSIGNMENT 1)
### E-Library API: Books & Members Management
### ==========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### ------------------------------------------
### 1. PENGUJIAN MODUL BUKU (BOOKS)
### ------------------------------------------

### 1.1. Ambil Semua Buku
GET {{baseUrl}}/books

### 1.2. Cari Buku Berdasarkan Kata Kunci (Query Param 'search')
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?search=Domain

### 1.3. Filter Buku yang Sedang Tersedia (Query Param 'available=true')
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?available=true

### 1.4. Ambil Detail Buku Berdasarkan ID (Route Param ':id')
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1

### 1.5. Ambil Detail Buku ID Tidak Ditemukan (Harus 404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/999

### 1.6. Tambah Buku Baru (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Pragmatic Programmer: Your Journey To Mastery",
  "author": "David Thomas, Andrew Hunt",
  "isbn": "978-0135957059",
  "publishedYear": 2019
}

### 1.7. Ganti Seluruh Data Buku ID #1 (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code: A Handbook of Agile Software Craftsmanship (Updated Edition)",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "isbn": "978-0132350884",
  "publishedYear": 2020
}

### 1.8. Perbarui Sebagian Data Buku ID #1 (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "publishedYear": 2021
}

### 1.9. Pinjam Buku ID #1 (PATCH /books/:id/borrow) -> isAvailable: false
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/books/1/borrow

### 1.10. Coba Pinjam Buku ID #1 Lagi (Harus 400 Bad Request: 'Buku sedang dipinjam!')
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/books/1/borrow

### 1.11. Kembalikan Buku ID #1 (PATCH /books/:id/return) -> isAvailable: true
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/books/1/return

### 1.12. Hapus Buku ID #3 (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/3


### ------------------------------------------
### 2. PENGUJIAN MODUL ANGGOTA (MEMBERS)
### ------------------------------------------

### 2.1. Ambil Semua Anggota
GET {{baseUrl}}/members

### 2.2. Cari Anggota Berdasarkan Nama/Email/Telepon
GET {{baseUrl}}/members?search=Pranata

### 2.3. Filter Anggota yang Aktif
GET {{baseUrl}}/members?active=true

### 2.4. Ambil Detail Anggota Berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/1

### 2.5. Detail Anggota Tidak Ditemukan (404 Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/888

### 2.6. Tambah Anggota Baru (POST)
POST {{baseUrl}}/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Ahmad Dahlan",
  "email": "ahmad.dahlan@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "081122334455"
}

### 2.7. Ganti Seluruh Data Anggota ID #2 (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/members/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Siti Aminah, M.Kom.",
  "email": "siti.aminah.mkom@example.com",
  "phoneNumber": "089876543999"
}

### 2.8. Perbarui Status Anggota ID #2 Menjadi Nonaktif (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/members/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### 2.9. Hapus Anggota ID #3 (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/members/3
